      "area": "docs",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "tag": "nit",
      "description": "\"a plain path's characters\" is vaguer than the set `A-Za-z0-9._/() -` it stands for. It doesn't say that the threat is newlines, control characters or escape sequences injecting lines into the context, or that space and parentheses are allowed on purpose. Naming both would keep a later edit from tightening or loosening the set by mistake.",
